{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33820","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 舴艋 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 舴艋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阔处只三尺，翛然足吾事。\n低篷挂钓车，枯蚌盛鱼饵。\n只好携桡坐，唯堪盖蓑睡。\n若遣遂平生，艅艎不如是。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33820.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33820","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}